    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Someone wants a place on a bootcamp\nPayment happens off-platform on a FastPayDirect link \u2014 one per\nprice tier. The CRM's job is to know which link was sent, to\nwhom, for which cohort, and whether it was ever paid. Without\nthat, an unpaid enrolment is invisible until the course starts.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "093996120399",
      "name": "1. Someone wants a place on a bootcamp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Find or create the person\nStudents usually sign up with a personal address, and the same\nperson often registers for a webinar first. Matching on email\nkeeps the webinar history and the enrolment on one record.",
        "height": 490,
        "width": 1080,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "003284419529",
      "name": "2. Find or create the person",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        540,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Create the enrolment and send the link\nThe enrolment is created as PAYMENT_SENT, not PAID. Nothing here\nconfirms money arrived \u2014 the payment provider does that, and\nuntil it does, this record is what the chase runs against.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "468330167911",
      "name": "3. Create the enrolment and send the link",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Make sure a human knows\nAn enrolment is the most valuable thing that happens in this\nfunnel. It gets a task with a due date and a message to the\nsales channel, so it cannot sit unnoticed while the cohort\nfills up.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "588614214030",
      "name": "4. Make sure a human knows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        540,
        760
      ]
    }
